<title>USA: XATA Corp completes Payne acquisition.</title>
<headline>XATA Corp completes Payne acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>XATA Corp said Monday it has completed its acquisition of Payne &amp; Associates from United Communications Group.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>XATA, a provider of onboard information systems for the fleet trucking industry, said it will operate Payne from its Peoria, Ill. location.</p>
<p>Payne products integrate information, communication and Internet-based technologies for the trucking industry.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
